E AX3004 1112-forward-alias.ax:5:10-11 type-mismatch "type mismatch: this function calls itself through an alias bound after its definition, which cannot be compiled" #"this call cannot be compiled" !"inference grounds a lambda's parameters from its uses; a use through a forward alias resolves only after the definition, past what the emitter can call" ?"name the function with `fn` and recurse through its name - a top-level name compiles to a direct call"
